\c6You are faced with a purple, 3 armed bartender whose nametag says YARGON

\c7Yes, I am the infamous Yargon, Bartender extraordinaire. We do two
things here, serve drinks and sign up team captains for the game.
What game you ask? Well, each team of mechs are competeing to see who will
destroy the pirate city first.  Each team member pays dues to a kitty that
grows and is awarded to the person who blasts Yarra into atoms. Dues are low,
for team members its five credits a day, captains its 25 a day.
You can either create your own team or join one.  To join, see the roster and
send Cyberlync mail to the captain asking to join. Now you just gonna nurse
that water you ordered or you gonna buy a real mans drink?

\c4Yargon walks away and spits into a glass to clean it.
